[50.18, "o", "SIGTERM (signal 15) asks a process to terminate gracefully.\r\n"]
[50.2, "o", "The process can catch it, clean up resources, and exit on its own terms.\r\n"]
[50.22, "o", "Unlike SIGKILL (9), it can be handled or ignored by the process.\r\n"]
